 "DDE":"transposase/integrase","HTH":"helix-turn-helix?","CX2CX":"zinc?","GDSL":"lipase",
 "EAL":"PDE","PAS":"sensor","HAMP":"linker","MCP":"methyl-accepting","PP2C":"phosphatase"}
